{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><figcaption>粉嶺欣翠花園有兒童懷疑猝死（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>粉嶺有兒童懷疑猝死。今日（17日）清晨6時許，警方接獲吉祥街8號欣翠花園一名男住戶報案，指其11歲兒子在住所睡房床上昏迷不醒。 救護員接報到場，證實男童已明顯死亡；警方相信事件無可疑，將案件列作「屍體發現」處理，將安排驗屍確定死因。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T02:19:21.896397+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":0,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T01:54:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T07:38:03.327808+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T02:17:39.986123+00:00","content_hash":"cdf3244b7907f5ac60d4b76d5a3567928789a85578e131076a49b9a144627706","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}